From 59a36a4250d4081e5ed2758228f4091732c0941d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Saturn <saturn@localhost>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 22:27:40 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 13/13] Saturn: start page art and menu, folders, full tab
 menus, Saturn menu

- Start page is the home of every window: it replaces the blank tab when
  the last tab closes, stays out of the tab list, and Ctrl+W on it asks
  first ("Press Ctrl+W again to close the browser").
- Start page art: Saturn with sunlight circling it (rings and planet shadow
  each other) and stars orbiting the planet; a black hole with a spinning,
  lensed accretion disk. Right-click the page for its menu: art, 12 symbol
  styles, scale (1x-3x), light speed and position (still, or scroll the
  wheel to turn the light), background (clear, gray, black). Choices are
  remembered; the search box blurs the art behind it.
- Folders in the Pinned list: create, rename, open/close, drag items in and
  out, collapse (keeps the tabs) or delete with its tabs.
- Drag a pinned tab below the divider to unpin it.
- Full context menus: tabs (Copy Link, Rename, Mute, Pin, Pin to
  favourites, Duplicate, Move to, Close), Pinned list (Edit Pinned page,
  Move to folder, Unpin, Delete), favourites (Edit Favorite page, Remove),
  and the empty sidebar (New Folder, Edit Space, Sort tabs by name, domain
  or recent use, Delete Space).
- Saturn menu on the logo button (and Alt+F): new tab / start page /
  window / incognito, Spaces, History, Downloads, Extensions, Developer
  tools, Print, Translate, Find, a zoom stepper, updates, GitHub, Settings,
  Close Saturn, with shortcuts shown. Menus open instantly with their rows
  rising into place, use the regular weight at 80% and full-width
  dividers.
- Space dots: hover pill, the hovered dot lights up and its space's name
  appears above.
- Zoom shows a small percentage badge over the page instead of a bubble.
- Title bar: 4px taller and translucent like the sidebar, with only
  Saturn's caption buttons; Alt no longer reaches Chromium's hidden menu.
- Tabler-based icons for the menus (saturn_tb_*.icon).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
